  "display_text": "Three days from now, after half a century in the service of our country, I shall lay down the responsibilities of office as, in traditional and solemn ceremony, the authority of the Presidency is vested in my successor. This evening I come to you with a message of leave taking and farewell, and to share a few final thoughts with you, my countrymen.",
